# ---- the search engine is not published from here ------------------------------------------
#
# engine/ holds the file-table reader the shell links against, plus the reference material it
# came from. It is kept out of this repository on purpose - see the README. A fresh clone
# therefore will not build until engine/Core/Spotter.Core.csproj exists.
engine/

# ---- build output --------------------------------------------------------------------------
bin/
obj/
publish/
tmpbin/
*.user
*.suo
.vs/

# Build transcripts. These were being committed alongside the source; msbuild -fl output is a
# record of one machine's build, never of the code.
*.log
!README*.log

# ---- runtime artefacts ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Logs live under %LOCALAPPDATA%\Spotter, but older builds wrote them next to the exe and the
# engine's own rotation leaves zips behind.
Spotter.log
Spotter.Engine.log
*.txt.zip
